DESCRIPTION:Easter Sunday is the central feast of the Christian year\, mark
 ing the resurrection of Jesus\, and it is the one major American holiday w
 hose date is computed rather than looked up: it can land anywhere from Mar
 ch 22 to April 25. Much of the folklore attached to it\, including the sto
 ry about a pagan goddess named Eostre and her sacred hare\, does not survi
 ve a look at the sources.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/easter-su
 nday/
