UID:memorial-day-20270531@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270531
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270601
SUMMARY:Memorial Day
DESCRIPTION:Memorial Day falls on the last Monday in May and honors America
 ns who died in military service — which is the distinction that matters\
 , because Veterans Day honors everyone who served. It began as Decoration 
 Day\, a Civil War observance of strewing flowers on graves\, and carried b
 oth names for most of a century. Where it started first is genuinely dispu
 ted\, and the federal government's own answer is not the only credible one
 .\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/memorial-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/memorial-day/
CATEGORIES:Community
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
